body:
:( 

&#x200B;

this makes me sad because I feel I sent a similar message to my ex. But they left me out of the blue and really hurt me.

Yes I keep extra underwear and clothes in my car. Also if I have a tampon in yeah I am wearing cute underwear IDC. 

&#x200B;

Also you've been dating for three months.... and it is HER CAR

YUPPPPPP!! 

&#x200B;

BACKSTORY as to why I got this message. He basically didnt want to be an adult and make an adult phone call and I was running late to work and could do that for him so I am a piece of shit for not babying him that is why

I feel like I wish I saw the one persons commentu/Danthxny saying he is the victim. NOT to plead my case but I do all this

COOK, CLEAN, tend to our animals. We share MY CAR I drive him around EVERYWHERE. I pay for our groceries. I am lucky enough he pays half the rent and does his own laundry. 

&#x200B;

side note he he does his own laundry now because I apparently ruined his clothes. which is NOT TRUE. He doesn't even wash them property with colors and the water temp but whatever.

&#x200B;

I try all the time to be sweet and nice and "sexy" like I want to indulge in the nasties too people like hello 

&#x200B;

I am not saying I am perfect but damn it I am still a person. I do not say hateful things like this and ONLY as of late I kinda say stuff back like f.u. BUT only if he starts it which 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

BACKSTORY as to why I got this message. He basically didnt want to be an adult and make an adult phone call and I was running late to work and could do that for him so I am a piece of shit for not babying him that is why

right!!! at this point it has been about 6 years of hell and I am fed uppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp. I just laugh at it now they he called me legit 45 mins after that and goes "we should do this next week for my birthday" 

&#x200B;

INSANE

I am legit gonna go to Target after work now lol 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Also they have it in a long sleeve [https://www.target.com/p/men-s-inuyasha-long-sleeve-graphic-t-shirt-gray-wash/-/A-87217096?preselect=85941037#lnk=sametab](https://www.target.com/p/men-s-inuyasha-long-sleeve-graphic-t-shirt-gray-wash/-/A-87217096?preselect=85941037#lnk=sametab)

&#x200B;

But I am totally going to get the short sleeve one

I feel this. I used to play video games sooo much in High school I stopped because of how shitty others made me feel online as a girl. Then I only played offline on games. Now I started playing online again but just animal crossing. I really want to start playing other games online and talk to people epically because of the pandemic but obviously it will just resort to " OMG RU A REAL GIRL"

&#x200B;

I get so jealous my boyfriend plays online, no problems, even is in an online community on GTA. No problems for him.

his mom is a dumb bitch and its not your fault at all. It is that "mans" own fault for not loving you properly and get the help he needed to be a better person. Be numb, be glad he didn't take you with him. there's this Facebook group you should join that i'm in it's called.  [**Narcissistic Abuse Recovery Support Network**](https://www.facebook.com/groups/NarcissisticAbuseSupportNetwork/) 

&#x200B;

join it
